{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_044420","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Mokèlé-mbèmbé是生活在刚果的恐龙。这已经不是什么神秘怪兽了，完全可以断定它是幸存至今的恐龙。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":134,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当地人都很熟悉这种生物。给他们看雷龙的复原图，所有人都会说那就是Mokèlé-mbèmbé。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":116,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"等尼加拉瓜恢复和平，我也想去趟刚果啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"……不过，格瓦拉的刚果革命最终以失败告终。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"是啊。要是那边的事我们也能想办法就好了，可非洲实在太远了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"非洲吗……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不知道El Che有没有见过Mokèlé-mbèmbé……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我也真想亲眼看看啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"现在比起非洲，<R=中美洲,这边>的事才是当务之急。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=中美洲,这边>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":68,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"是这么说没错……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""}]}